+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Chain-parallel verify update kernel (SGLANG_GDN_CONV_CHAIN_PARALLEL=1).
+#
+# `_causal_conv1d_update_kernel` walks the `seqlen` speculative tokens of a
